      "Illustrative changed-content fixture based on EnableComp source slide 5 (source deck SHA-256 22c39b27bd97fece99008fd456cdde377ec0750eb296100d8570ee83f767c77b). Source visual uses a rotated triangle behind five need tiles; this fixture uses an editable rightArrow as a source-like directional treatment. Five source SVG icons are preserved as pinned originals and rendered to 8x AppKit PNG previews because the current compose image decoder accepts PNG/JPEG, not SVG. Derived PNGs are raster previews, not editable vectors; see samples/visual-wave2/response-assets.json for original and derived hashes. Need labels and response titles/body are adapted sample copy; source panel geometry is retained approximately. This is a nonnative probe fixture and not native PowerPoint rendering evidence."
